Implement:
```python
def _resolve_adapter(adapter_name, local_files_only):
    p=Path(adapter_name)
    if p.exists(): return str(p)
    try:
        from huggingface_hub import snapshot_download
        return snapshot_download(adapter_name, local_files_only=True)
    except Exception:
        if local_files_only: raise
        return snapshot_download(adapter_name, allow_patterns=[...], ignore_patterns=[".gitattributes"])
```
Then load_adapter(resolved, set_active=True). This makes behavior deterministic. If adapter_name is a hub id but download fails, fallback to load_adapter(adapter_name) maybe.

