Draft README (Chinese, clear):

# SPECTER2 遗传变异病例筛选基线

## 1. 目的与范围
- Input paper metadata/fulltext, output relevant/review/irrelevant for prenatal genetic variant case reports.
- Frozen SPECTER2 + classification adapter, 2304+2 features, logistic regression. No fine-tune.
- Data 974 labels 699/275; split.

## 2. 目录与数据
- files.
- `data/labeled_papers.csv` schema.
- fulltext package restore command.
- build stats.

## 3. 环境安装
- Python 3.12 (uv).
- `uv venv --python 3.12 .venv` then `uv pip install -r requirements.txt`
- GPU torch: `uv pip install torch --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124` (but requirements default installs cu132 on this machine). Note driver absent here; CPU fallback.
- HF cache: base local path; adapter downloaded to `.cache/huggingface` if home read-only; env overrides `SPECTER2_BASE_PATH`, `SPECTER2_ADAPTER`, `HF_HOME`.
- Note adapter version; network first time.

## 4. 数据构建
```
python build_dataset.py
```
stats table actual.
- 974/974 join; 764 abstract; 974 fulltext (768 TXT, 206 PDF); 161 manifest TXT/XML missing but PDF fallback; 210 no abstract.
- build_stats.json.

## 5. 训练
```
python train.py --batch-size 32
```
- cache; first ~35 min CPU, then seconds; `--force-reencode`.
- splits GroupShuffleSplit 64/16/20.
- default subset 883; full control 974.
- threshold recall target 0.95.
- ablations A/B/C.
- outputs.
- metrics table (fill).

## 6. 预测
- sample, pdf, json, csv.
- output fields.

## 7. API
- command; health; JSON; multipart PDF; response.

## 8. 设计细节
- chunking 3000 chars overlap 400 max 24 evenly sampled.
- normalize.
- no text zeros.
- aux features.
- decision band.
- no fine-tune.

## 9. 可复现命令/测试
- py_compile, smoke.

## 10. 已知限制
- GPU unavailable here; torch cu132 installed but CUDA false. Classifier adapter has no head (only encoder weights; embeddings).
- abstract only for 764; 210 empty.
- 161 txt/xml advertised but missing; PDF fallback.
- labels include weak/model excluded by default; full control reported.
- No PDF OCR (scanned PDFs would be empty) — but all 206 extracted >0.
- Single split; no CV; small n.
- review band 0.15 fixed, chosen heuristically.
- API single worker; no auth/rate limit; PDF max 30MB.
- Data leakage caveat: labels partly model-generated excluded.
- Not clinical use.

## 11. 文件清单.

